    "detail":  "Task id: validate-all-remote-firebase-state-at-ingress-no-881b\nTitle: Validate all remote Firebase state at ingress, not just names\nDescription:\nThe html-injection task hardened player names, colors, and portraits as enumerated/length-limited untrusted values, and the new database rules enforce writer/owner/revision constraints server-side. Extend client-side ingress validation to the full incoming multiplayer snapshot: when applying remote state (sync.js state listeners and game.js state-apply paths), validate types/ranges/enums for every consumed field (player counts, positions, health/incapacitated counters, inventory ids, tile ids, revision numbers) and reject or clamp malformed values instead of trusting them. A compromised or buggy client (or one that predates the rules deploy) must not be able to corrupt another client\u0027s local state. Add tests feeding hostile/malformed snapshots through the apply path and asserting safe rejection.\n\nReport progress and completion through POST http://localhost:8488/agent/report with task_id \"validate-all-remote-firebase-state-at-ingress-no-881b\". Do not edit .tasker/tasks files or change task status directly."
